+| `SCORE-FX-04` | From score 325, streak 3, correct. | One event: `+150`, streak 4, score 475; bonus rises to +50. |
+| `SCORE-FX-05` | From score 475, streak 4, correct. | One event: `+175`, streak 5, score 650; feedback names the +75 bonus. |
